    "text": "## sub_403CD0_00403cd0 — Track spline data lookup with interpolation\n\n**Summary:** Looks up position and orientation data from a track spline array indexed by node index. If the requested entry is zero-initialized (invalid/missing), walks backwards in steps of 2 to find the nearest valid entries and performs linear interpolation between them; falls back to first entry if no valid pair exists.\n\n**Frame-path:** ON_FRAME_PATH  \n**Call frequency:** per-frame tick\n\n**Called by:** AISteeringRacingLineCorrection (0042b0e0), TrackSplineExtrapolation (004349a0), SteeringInterpolationCameraFollow (00434d60), SpecialFX_Init (004cf070)\n\n**Struct fields accessed:**\n\n| Base | Offset | R/W | Init (literal → value) | Purpose |\n|------|--------|-----|------------------------|---------|\n| this | 0x150 | R | — | pointer to track spline data array (7 floats per entry: position xyz + orientation xyz + unknown) |\n| this | 0x154 | R | — | unknown — not directly referenced in decompiled C |\n| this | 0x158 | R | — | unknown — not directly referenced in decompiled C |\n| this | 0x15C | R | — | unknown — not directly referenced in decompiled C |\n| this | 0x160 | R | — | unknown — not directly referenced in decompiled C |\n| this | 0x164 | R | — | unknown — not directly referenced in decompiled C |\n\n**Globals referenced:**\n\n| Address | Name | R/W | Role |\n|---------|------|-----|------|\n| 0059e440 | flt_59E440 | R | ZeroThreshold (~0.0f, physics clamp) [DERIVED] |\n\n**Functions called:** none\n\n**Guard conditions:** No early-return guards. Three code paths selected by data content: (1) If entry at index `a2` has all 6 floats (position + orientation) == 0.0, attempt interpolation path; (2) within interpolation path, if no valid non-zero pair is found (v6 < 2 or candidate pair also all-zero), fall back to first entry (index 0); (3) if entry at `a2` has any non-zero float, direct copy path — copies position and orientation directly from indexed entry.\n"
